{"title": "Impaled (Condition)", "pageid": 34060, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Impaled_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack priority", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Damage Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Impaled</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>A ghoul's spike prevents this creature from moving. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">HAV_GHOULSPIKED</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HAV_GHOULSPIKED+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HAV_GHOULSPIKED+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">KNOCKED_OUT_SURRENDER</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CKNOCKED_OUT_SURRENDER%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CKNOCKED_OUT_SURRENDER%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 3\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/AllowLeaveCombat\" title=\"Status properties/AllowLeaveCombat\">AllowLeaveCombat</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Impaled\">Sources of Impaled</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Several NPC's at <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a> receive this condition if they fail at D20 <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> check when the location is ambushed by <a href=\"/wiki/Winged_Horror\" title=\"Winged Horror\">Winged Horrors</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition lasts for the duration of the combat encounter.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>KNOCKED_OUT_SURRENDER</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Impaled\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Impaled_(Condition)\" title=\"Impaled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Impaled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Impaled</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>A ghoul's spike prevents this creature from moving.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Sapped\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sapped_(Condition)\" title=\"Sapped (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Sapped_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sapped_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Sapped_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Sapped_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Sapped_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Sapped_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sapped\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Sapped_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sapped_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Sapped_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sapped_(Condition)\" title=\"Sapped (Condition)\">Sapped</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Target has been psionically drained.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1765/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20075/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4566/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1352467/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.203      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   46.203      1 -total\n 36.11%   16.686      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 19.08%    8.818      5 Template:Icon_link\n 17.96%    8.298     20 Template:Trim\n 17.95%    8.295      5 Template:Icon_text\n 14.68%    6.782      4 Template:Template_style\n 14.05%    6.490      2 Template:Condition_sources\n  8.11%    3.748      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.05%    3.719      2 Template:Uid_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34060-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714205000 and revision id 398149. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}